I went inside the café.
There were many people there.
A woman came to me.
She was smiling a lot.
She asked me, "Are you Maya?"
I said, "Yes, I am Maya."
She said, "My name is Sunita, I work here."
Sunita ji has been running this place for many years.
She is very experienced and cheerful.
I told her, "Sunita ji, this is my first day."
"I have never worked in a café before."
Sunita ji smiled and said, "No problem."
"Learning to work here is very easy."
She gave me a clean apron.
"This is your apron, put it on," she said.
I took the apron and put it on.
I really like meeting people and learning new things.
Now I was ready to start my first shift.
